{"path":"/industries/crypto-digital-assets/","slug":"industries__crypto-digital-assets","kind":"industry","title":"Crypto Website Design & Webflow Support | Legency Media","description":"Webflow builds and support for exchanges, protocols, wallets and custody firms: listing pages live inside an agreed turnaround, wording per jurisdiction.","source":"live","stylesheets":["/_astro/global.Btqt_PqA.css","/_astro/Base.D9X9tJbq.css","/_astro/ConsentBanner.Bjqg_HPr.css","/_astro/FaqSection.BU63QfoB.css","/_astro/ServiceLayout.DWPKQstD.css"],"scripts":["/_astro/Nav.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BTi8Y4C0.js","/_astro/Footer.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.QLgbxcz6.js","/_astro/ConsentBanner.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BlWZOVqD.js","/_astro/Base.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BUtqXeGZ.js","/_astro/Base.astro_astro_type_script_index_1_lang.s69FG7Vr.js"],"mainHtml":"<section class=\"svc-hero\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"svc-hero__tex\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/secondary-hero.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm></div><div class=\"container svc-hero__inner\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Industries</span><h1 class=\"svc-hero__title\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Crypto &amp; Digital Assets</h1><p class=\"svc-hero__sub\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Your markets never close and your marketing site has to keep the same hours. We run the Webflow site for exchanges, protocols, wallets and custody firms as a standing service: listings, campaigns and jurisdiction wording live inside an agreed turnaround, and none of it lands on the product team&#39;s plate.</p><a class=\"btn-bubble-arrow btn-bubble-arrow--blue\" href=\"/get-in-touch/\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh=\"true\"><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><span class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content-text\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh>Get in touch</span></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow is--duplicate\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div></a></div></section><section class=\"section evo\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__head\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Where the Site Falls Behind</span><h2 class=\"evo__heading\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Where a Crypto Marketing Site Falls Behind the Market</h2></div><div class=\"evo__grid\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__col\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__colhead\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"evo__kicker\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The Problem</span><span class=\"evo__coltitle\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Standard Agency</span></div><div class=\"evo__cards\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--light\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M20 20H4V4\"/><path d=\"M4 16.5L12 9L15 12L19.5 7.5\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The listing is announced before the page exists</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>A new market or token goes live on the exchange and in the community before the marketing site mentions it. The page that should carry the announcement is waiting in a ticket queue behind product work, and traders read about it somewhere else.</p></article><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--light\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M9.00001 21L8.00001 21C6.89544 21 6.00001 20.1057 6.00001 19.0011C6.00001 17.4501 6.00001 15.3443 6 14C6 13 4.5 12 4.5 12C4.5 12 6.00001 11 6.00001 10C6.00001 8.827 6.00001 6.62207 6.00001 4.99914C6.00001 3.89457 6.89544 3 8.00001 3L9.00001 3\"/><path d=\"M15 21L16 21C17.1046 21 18 20.1057 18 19.0011C18 17.4501 18 15.3443 18 14C18 13 19.5 12 19.5 12C19.5 12 18 11 18 10C18 8.827 18 6.62207 18 4.99914C18 3.89457 17.1046 3 16 3L15 3\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Engineering owns a site it never asked for</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The marketing site sits in the same repository and release process as the product. Every copy change waits for a deploy window, and every campaign page costs an engineer a day the roadmap had already spent.</p></article><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--light\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M6 6L18 6\"/><path d=\"M6 10H18\"/><path d=\"M13 14L18 14\"/><path d=\"M13 18L18 18\"/><path d=\"M2 21.4V2.6C2 2.26863 2.26863 2 2.6 2H21.4C21.7314 2 22 2.26863 22 2.6V21.4C22 21.7314 21.7314 22 21.4 22H2.6C2.26863 22 2 21.7314 2 21.4Z\"/><path d=\"M6 18V14H9V18H6Z\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Regulatory wording drifts out of date by region</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>What the site may say about a product differs by jurisdiction and changes with each new rule. When updates take days, one region&#39;s page carries wording the compliance team retired last week, and nobody notices until a regulator does.</p></article></div></div><div class=\"evo__col\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__colhead\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"evo__kicker\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The Solution</span><span class=\"evo__coltitle evo__coltitle--brand\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><img src=\"/img/mark.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"evo__logo\" width=\"57\" height=\"57\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The Legency Approach</span></span></div><div class=\"evo__cards evo__cards--dark\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__scene\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/band-loop.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-us-lazyload=\"true\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm></div><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--dark\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--on-dark\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M13 10V3L5 14H11V21L19 10H13Z\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Listing pages go live inside an agreed turnaround</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Requests go into a shared channel with the person doing the build. Standard requests are answered within one business day and urgent work is turned around before the day is out, so the page is up when the announcement goes out.</p></article><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--dark\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--on-dark\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M5.21173 15.1113L2.52473 12.4243C2.29041 12.1899 2.29041 11.8101 2.52473 11.5757L5.21173 8.88873C5.44605 8.65442 5.82595 8.65442 6.06026 8.88873L8.74727 11.5757C8.98158 11.8101 8.98158 12.1899 8.74727 12.4243L6.06026 15.1113C5.82595 15.3456 5.44605 15.3456 5.21173 15.1113Z\"/><path d=\"M11.5757 21.475L8.88874 18.788C8.65443 18.5537 8.65443 18.1738 8.88874 17.9395L11.5757 15.2525C11.8101 15.0182 12.19 15.0182 12.4243 15.2525L15.1113 17.9395C15.3456 18.1738 15.3456 18.5537 15.1113 18.788L12.4243 21.475C12.19 21.7094 11.8101 21.7094 11.5757 21.475Z\"/><path d=\"M11.5757 8.7475L8.88874 6.06049C8.65443 5.82618 8.65443 5.44628 8.88874 5.21197L11.5757 2.52496C11.8101 2.29065 12.19 2.29065 12.4243 2.52496L15.1113 5.21197C15.3456 5.44628 15.3456 5.82618 15.1113 6.06049L12.4243 8.7475C12.19 8.98181 11.8101 8.98181 11.5757 8.7475Z\"/><path d=\"M17.9396 15.1113L15.2526 12.4243C15.0183 12.1899 15.0183 11.8101 15.2526 11.5757L17.9396 8.88873C18.174 8.65442 18.5539 8.65442 18.7882 8.88873L21.4752 11.5757C21.7095 11.8101 21.7095 12.1899 21.4752 12.4243L18.7882 15.1113C18.5539 15.3456 18.174 15.3456 17.9396 15.1113Z\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The marketing site comes off the product team&#39;s plate</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The site runs on Webflow with a component system the marketing team publishes from, separate from the product release cycle. Engineers stop fielding copy changes, and the roadmap keeps the people it was planned around.</p></article><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--dark\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--on-dark\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M8.5 11.5L11.5 14.5L16.5 9.5\"/><path d=\"M5 18L3.13036 4.91253C3.05646 4.39524 3.39389 3.91247 3.90398 3.79912L11.5661 2.09641C11.8519 2.03291 12.1481 2.03291 12.4339 2.09641L20.096 3.79912C20.6061 3.91247 20.9435 4.39524 20.8696 4.91252L19 18C18.9293 18.495 18.5 21.5 12 21.5C5.5 21.5 5.07071 18.495 5 18Z\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Compliance wording changes in one place per region</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Disclosures, risk warnings and eligibility text are held as shared content, so a rule change in one jurisdiction is a single edit that updates every page carrying it. Staging comes first, so the compliance owner signs off before publish.</p></article></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section foundation\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><div class=\"foundation__head\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><div data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Built for the Category</span><h2 class=\"foundation__heading\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Four Things a Crypto Engagement Delivers</h2></div></div><div class=\"foundation__grid\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><article class=\"found-card\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M17 12.5C17.2761 12.5 17.5 12.2761 17.5 12C17.5 11.7239 17.2761 11.5 17 11.5C16.7239 11.5 16.5 11.7239 16.5 12C16.5 12.2761 16.7239 12.5 17 12.5Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M12 12.5C12.2761 12.5 12.5 12.2761 12.5 12C12.5 11.7239 12.2761 11.5 12 11.5C11.7239 11.5 11.5 11.7239 11.5 12C11.5 12.2761 11.7239 12.5 12 12.5Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M7 12.5C7.27614 12.5 7.5 12.2761 7.5 12C7.5 11.7239 7.27614 11.5 7 11.5C6.72386 11.5 6.5 11.7239 6.5 12C6.5 12.2761 6.72386 12.5 7 12.5Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M12 22C17.5228 22 22 17.5228 22 12C22 6.47715 17.5228 2 12 2C6.47715 2 2 6.47715 2 12C2 13.8214 2.48697 15.5291 3.33782 17L2.5 21.5L7 20.6622C8.47087 21.513 10.1786 22 12 22Z\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>A Named Owner for the Marketing Site</h3><p data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>One accountable partner runs the Webflow site as a standing service, with a committed turnaround in a shared channel, so nobody on the product team is the fallback when a page needs to change.</p></article><article class=\"found-card\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M5.21173 15.1113L2.52473 12.4243C2.29041 12.1899 2.29041 11.8101 2.52473 11.5757L5.21173 8.88873C5.44605 8.65442 5.82595 8.65442 6.06026 8.88873L8.74727 11.5757C8.98158 11.8101 8.98158 12.1899 8.74727 12.4243L6.06026 15.1113C5.82595 15.3456 5.44605 15.3456 5.21173 15.1113Z\"/><path d=\"M11.5757 21.475L8.88874 18.788C8.65443 18.5537 8.65443 18.1738 8.88874 17.9395L11.5757 15.2525C11.8101 15.0182 12.19 15.0182 12.4243 15.2525L15.1113 17.9395C15.3456 18.1738 15.3456 18.5537 15.1113 18.788L12.4243 21.475C12.19 21.7094 11.8101 21.7094 11.5757 21.475Z\"/><path d=\"M11.5757 8.7475L8.88874 6.06049C8.65443 5.82618 8.65443 5.44628 8.88874 5.21197L11.5757 2.52496C11.8101 2.29065 12.19 2.29065 12.4243 2.52496L15.1113 5.21197C15.3456 5.44628 15.3456 5.82618 15.1113 6.06049L12.4243 8.7475C12.19 8.98181 11.8101 8.98181 11.5757 8.7475Z\"/><path d=\"M17.9396 15.1113L15.2526 12.4243C15.0183 12.1899 15.0183 11.8101 15.2526 11.5757L17.9396 8.88873C18.174 8.65442 18.5539 8.65442 18.7882 8.88873L21.4752 11.5757C21.7095 11.8101 21.7095 12.1899 21.4752 12.4243L18.7882 15.1113C18.5539 15.3456 18.174 15.3456 17.9396 15.1113Z\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Campaign Pages Built From One Pattern</h3><p data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Trading competitions, incentive programmes and referral drives each get a page built from the same pattern, pointed at that campaign&#39;s own data and shipped to staging first, so campaigns never cross.</p></article><article class=\"found-card\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M18.5 15L5.5 15\"/><path d=\"M16 4L8 4\"/><path d=\"M9 4.5L9 10.2602C9 10.7376 8.82922 11.1992 8.51851 11.5617L3.48149 17.4383C3.17078 17.8008 3 18.2624 3 18.7398V19C3 20.1046 3.89543 21 5 21L19 21C20.1046 21 21 20.1046 21 19V18.7398C21 18.2624 20.8292 17.8008 20.5185 17.4383L15.4815 11.5617C15.1708 11.1992 15 10.7376 15 10.2602L15 4.5\"/><path d=\"M12 9.01L12.01 8.99889\"/><path d=\"M11 2.01L11.01 1.99889\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Split Testing on a Standing Cycle</h3><p data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Tests run through Webflow Optimize one section at a time, with the build, the monitoring, the result and a recommendation for the next test, so the team always knows what to try on the page next.</p></article><article class=\"found-card\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M17 20V4M17 4L20 7M17 4L14 7\"/><path d=\"M7 4V20M7 20L10 17M7 20L4 17\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>A Site Kept Light Under Load</h3><p data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Asset weight, bandwidth and plan limits are watched as part of the service, so a listing day or an airdrop announcement is served as a normal day and never becomes an incident for engineering.</p></article></div></div></section><section class=\"section dp\" data-astro-cid-twzdy2po><div class=\"container dp__head\" data-astro-cid-twzdy2po><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-twzdy2po>The Site as Infrastructure</span><h2 class=\"dp__heading\" data-astro-cid-twzdy2po>A Marketing Site Judged on Uptime and Asset Weight</h2><p class=\"dp__sub\" data-astro-cid-twzdy2po>Crypto teams read a website the way they read a node: does it stay up, how heavy is it, what does the plan cap. The marketing site is part of the technical estate, and it is run as one.</p></div><div class=\"container dp__cards\" data-astro-cid-twzdy2po><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-twzdy2po><h3 data-astro-cid-twzdy2po>Asset weight kept in check</h3><p data-astro-cid-twzdy2po>Hero video, token logos and chart images add up fast. Every asset is compressed and sized before it ships, so the page stays quick on a phone for a trader checking a market between meetings.</p></article><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-twzdy2po><h3 data-astro-cid-twzdy2po>Plan limits watched ahead of each launch</h3><p data-astro-cid-twzdy2po>Bandwidth, CMS item counts and form submissions all have ceilings on a Webflow plan. They are tracked as part of the service, so a growing list of markets or a viral campaign does not hit a cap unannounced.</p></article><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-twzdy2po><h3 data-astro-cid-twzdy2po>Staging before every publish</h3><p data-astro-cid-twzdy2po>Every change ships to staging first and goes live on approval. A campaign page is checked against its own data before a trader sees it, and each campaign stays isolated so competitions never cross.</p></article><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-twzdy2po><h3 data-astro-cid-twzdy2po>A change record engineering can read</h3><p data-astro-cid-twzdy2po>Who changed what, and when, is recorded for every request in the shared channel. When a page moves and someone asks why, the answer exists, with a date and the person who made it.</p></article></div></section><section class=\"section dp dp--alt\" data-astro-cid-twzdy2po><div class=\"container dp__head\" data-astro-cid-twzdy2po><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-twzdy2po>When the Market Moves</span><h2 class=\"dp__heading\" data-astro-cid-twzdy2po>The Site Changes the Hour the Market Does</h2><p class=\"dp__sub\" data-astro-cid-twzdy2po>A listing, a new market, a delisting or a regulatory notice each need the site to say something different within hours. The service is built around that cadence, with the same shared channel carrying all of it.</p></div><div class=\"container dp__cards dp__cards--three\" data-astro-cid-twzdy2po><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-twzdy2po><h3 data-astro-cid-twzdy2po>Listings and markets</h3><p data-astro-cid-twzdy2po>A new market gets its page, its navigation entry and its announcement banner in one request. A delisting removes them in one request, with redirects in place so search traffic still lands on a live page.</p></article><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-twzdy2po><h3 data-astro-cid-twzdy2po>Campaigns and competitions</h3><p data-astro-cid-twzdy2po>Each trading competition reuses the same self-serve claim pattern: build the page, point it at that campaign's reward data, ship to staging first. A trader enters a wallet address, gets an instant eligibility answer, and every claim is logged automatically.</p></article><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-twzdy2po><h3 data-astro-cid-twzdy2po>Regulatory notices by region</h3><p data-astro-cid-twzdy2po>When a regulator in one jurisdiction changes what may be said about a product, the wording for that region is updated once and every page carrying it follows. Pages for every other region stay as they were.</p></article></div></section><section class=\"caseband\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><div class=\"pixelated-scroll-transition\" data-pixelated-scroll-transition data-columns=\"24\" data-columns-tablet=\"18\" data-columns-mobile=\"10\" data-rows=\"8\" data-mode=\"reveal\" style=\"color:var(--bg)\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"caseband__scene\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/band-loop.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-us-lazyload=\"true\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f></div><div class=\"container caseband__inner\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><div class=\"caseband__content\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><span class=\"label label--on-dark\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f>Case Study</span><span class=\"caseband__chip\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><img src=\"/img/partners/dydx.svg\" alt=\"dYdX\" loading=\"lazy\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f></span><h2 class=\"caseband__heading\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f>Working with dYdX since 2025.</h2><p class=\"caseband__text\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f>dYdX runs a decentralized crypto exchange whose markets trade around the clock. Its Webflow development moved to us in 2025 and has run continuously since: urgent fixes turned around the same day, a standing split-testing programme through Webflow Optimize, and a self-serve rewards claim page for every trading competition. The relationship has since continued into a new engagement with Arcus.</p><a class=\"btn-bubble-arrow btn-bubble-arrow--white\" href=\"/case-studies/dydx/\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh=\"true\"><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><span class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content-text\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh>View Case Study</span></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow is--duplicate\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div></a></div><div class=\"caseband__media\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><img src=\"/img/covers/case-dydx.jpg\" alt=\"Horizontal light streaks across a dark field, rendered as a blue pixel dither, captioned Same-day, every day\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f></div></div></section><section class=\"ctaband\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><div class=\"ctaband__scene\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/band-loop.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-us-lazyload=\"true\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz></div><div class=\"container ctaband__inner\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><div class=\"ctaband__text\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><span class=\"label label--on-dark\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>Start With the Site as It Runs Today</span><h2 class=\"ctaband__heading\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>What the Marketing Site Costs Your Engineers</h2><p class=\"ctaband__body\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>A call about the marketing site as it stands: who owns it, what currently waits on a deploy, how long a listing page takes to go live, and what the plan limits look like on a high-traffic day.</p></div><div class=\"ctaband__side\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><ul class=\"ctaband__points\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><li data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>Where copy and campaign changes currently wait on engineering</li><li data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>Asset weight, bandwidth and plan headroom against a listing-day spike</li><li data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>How many places each region&#39;s regulatory wording lives in</li><li data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>What a standing Webflow service would take off the roadmap</li></ul><div class=\"ctaband__actions\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><a class=\"btn-bubble-arrow btn-bubble-arrow--white\" href=\"/schedule/\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh=\"true\"><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><span class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content-text\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh>Book a Discovery Call</span></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow is--duplicate\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div></a><a class=\"ctaband__quiet\" href=\"/services/webflow-support/\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>How Webflow support works</a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section faq\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__head\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Common Questions</span><h2 class=\"faq__heading\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Frequently Asked<br data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Questions</h2></div><div class=\"faq__list\" data-faq data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-0\" id=\"faq-btn-0\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Can you run our marketing site without touching the product codebase?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-0\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-0\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Yes. The marketing site runs on Webflow, separate from the product repository and its release cycle. Engineering keeps the app and the protocol, the marketing team publishes pages from a component system, and we carry the build and the upkeep. The product deploy calendar stays exactly as it is.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-1\" id=\"faq-btn-1\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>How fast can a listing or campaign page go live?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-1\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-1\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Requests go into a shared channel with the person doing the build, with a committed turnaround. Standard work is answered within one business day and urgent work is turned around the same day. A campaign page built from an existing pattern is a data change rather than a rebuild, which is how dYdX ships each new trading competition.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-2\" id=\"faq-btn-2\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>How do you handle compliance wording that differs by jurisdiction?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-2\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-2\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Disclosures, risk warnings and eligibility text are held as shared content with one entry per region, so a rule change in one jurisdiction is a single edit that updates every page carrying it. Every change ships to staging first, so the compliance owner signs off before anything is published.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-3\" id=\"faq-btn-3\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Will the site hold up on a listing day or an airdrop announcement?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-3\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-3\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Asset weight, bandwidth and plan limits are tracked as part of the service, and heavy media is compressed before it ships. Webflow serves the site from a global CDN and the hosting plan is sized for the peaks a launch brings, so a traffic spike is handled as a normal day rather than an incident.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-4\" id=\"faq-btn-4\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Do you work with wallets, custody and on-chain data companies, or only exchanges?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-4\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-4\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>The service is the same across the category: exchanges, protocols, wallets, custody providers and on-chain data platforms. Each has a product team that should be shipping product, a marketing site that has to change when the market does, and wording that differs by where the customer lives.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-5\" id=\"faq-btn-5\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>What happens to the engagement if the company rebrands or restructures?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-5\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-5\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>The work carries over. The Webflow support we began with dYdX in 2025 continued into a new engagement with Arcus, on the same shared channel and the same turnaround. A rebrand or a new domain is scoped as a project inside the standing service, with redirects in place so search traffic follows.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section>","inlineStyles":[".transition {\n          display: none;\n        }",".dp__grid[data-astro-cid-twzdy2po]{gap:var(--sp-5);grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);align-items:center;display:grid}.dp__heading[data-astro-cid-twzdy2po]{font-size:var(--h4);margin-bottom:var(--sp-3);max-width:24ch}.dp__text[data-astro-cid-twzdy2po] p[data-astro-cid-twzdy2po],.dp__sub[data-astro-cid-twzdy2po]{font-size:var(--para-sm);max-width:56ch;margin-bottom:var(--sp-2)}.dp__note[data-astro-cid-twzdy2po]{opacity:.7}.dp__head[data-astro-cid-twzdy2po]{margin-bottom:var(--sp-4);max-width:64ch}.dp--alt[data-astro-cid-twzdy2po]{background:var(--white)}.dp__cards[data-astro-cid-twzdy2po]{gap:var(--sp-3);grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));display:grid}.dp__cards--three[data-astro-cid-twzdy2po]{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr))}.dp__card[data-astro-cid-twzdy2po]{background:var(--white);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:var(--sp-4)}.dp--alt[data-astro-cid-twzdy2po] .dp__card[data-astro-cid-twzdy2po]{background:var(--bg)}.dp__card[data-astro-cid-twzdy2po] h3[data-astro-cid-twzdy2po]{font-size:var(--h6);margin-bottom:var(--sp-2);max-width:26ch}.dp__card[data-astro-cid-twzdy2po] p[data-astro-cid-twzdy2po]{font-size:var(--para-sm)}.dp__steps[data-astro-cid-twzdy2po]{gap:var(--sp-2);list-style:none;display:grid}.dp__step[data-astro-cid-twzdy2po]{gap:var(--sp-4);background:var(--white);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:var(--sp-4);grid-template